== Fashion E-commerce

Global fashion e-commerce exceeded *770 billion USD* in 2024, projected to surpass *one trillion by 2030* @statista2024fashion. The *semantic gap* -- the mismatch between a garment's visual attributes (silhouette, drape, pattern rhythm, colour relationships) and the user's ability to express them in keywords -- drives a *30 percent search abandonment rate* @pinterest2023visual. This market scale and interface failure together define the problem domain addressed by the thesis.
